xt":"drives two "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" nodes that flip the shape between its base and an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enlarged state; the switch state feeds a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"builtin.point3D"},{"type":"text","text":" Transform Scale, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the pop is animated with a spring. At rest a white rounded triangle sits at base"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale, centered on the magenta artboard."}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_PinchView","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/fileExporter(isPresented:documents:contentType:onCompletion:)-6gdz":{"role":"symbol","title":"fileExporter(isPresented:documents:contentType:onCompletion:)","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/fileExporter(isPresented:documents:contentType:onCompletion:)-6gdz","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/fileexporter(ispresented:documents:contenttype:oncompletion:)-6gdz","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"fileExporter","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"isPresented","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI7BindingV","text":"Binding","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"documents","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"contentType","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:22UniformTypeIdentifiers6UTTypeV","text":"UTType","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onCompletion","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6ResultO","text":"Result","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<[","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","text":"URL","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"], any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s5ErrorP","text":"Error","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">) -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}